{"id":"n67288-1-11","stage":4,"title":"언짢다 · 不舒服","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67288-1-11-1","ko":"너 자꾸 사람 언짢게 만들래?","zh":"你是不是故意要惹人生气的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}},{"text":"언짢게","meaning":"不舒服，不愉快，懊恼","explanation":"언짢다：不舒服，不愉快，懊恼；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"언짢다","audio":"/audio/b0a010bf49a4f770b973.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67288","senseId":"1","lemma":"언짢다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언짢게","audio":"/audio/1ad56953438ccb0d54d5.mp3"}},{"text":"만들래?","meaning":"使成为","explanation":"만들다：使成为；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"14","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만들래","audio":"/audio/5c619783d99679259d7b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"b0a010bf49a4f770","term":"언짢다","zh":"不舒服，不愉快，懊恼","audio":"/audio/b0a010bf49a4f770b973.mp3","entryId":"67288","definition":"不中意或心情不好。","pronunciation":["언짠타"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"使成为","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"怎样使人、事物或现象发生改变。","pronunciation":["만들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7da42c19017e4a8c34fb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67288-1-11-2","ko":"죄송해요. 기분이 나쁘신지 몰랐어요.","zh":"对不起，我没意识到您会不高兴。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송해요.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송해요","audio":"/audio/e9f7fd1f9febb8b27ec0.mp3"}},{"text":"기분이","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기분이","audio":"/audio/2c7d19f699b942f8cc0b.mp3"}},{"text":"나쁘신지","meaning":"糟糕，不好","explanation":"나쁘다：糟糕，不好；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"2","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나쁘신지","audio":"/audio/2bdaa27b7845b6fe540e.mp3"}},{"text":"몰랐어요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰랐어요","audio":"/audio/89740e53249dc39b7308.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"b67c592bde724aa1","term":"나쁘다","zh":"糟糕，不好","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3","entryId":"26816","definition":"不称心或感觉不太好。","pronunciation":["나쁘다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1706b14bb2b4f9214ffb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.176,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67288","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":122,"sequenceScore":2.0027,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对不起，我没意识到您会不高兴。","今天怎么一大早就这么忙啊？","你是不是故意要惹人生气的？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对不起，我没意识到您会不高兴。","你是不是故意要惹人生气的？","今天怎么一大早就这么忙啊？"],"answer":0}]}
